          "content": "- [Household](user_household.md) - roommate Jules, flat at 55 Elm Court 2B, who holds which bill\n- [Coffee](user_coffee.md) - the usual bag and how many to buy\n- [Drive layout](reference_drive_layout.md) - Bills/, Receipts/, Private/, Project/\n- [Bank](reference_bank.md) - one checking account, card ending 4417\n- [Short replies](feedback_short_replies.md) - report back in a few lines with the figures\n- [Routine](user_routine.md) - payday every other Friday, money admin on Sunday evenings\n- [Shop account](reference_shop.md) - delivery address and card on the online shop\n- [Confirm first](feedback_confirm_first.md) - check a shared figure with Jules before paying it\n- [Renter's insurance](project_renters_insurance.md) - renews Dec 15, compare quotes\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/user_household.md",
          "content": "---\nname: user-household\ndescription: Marcus's flat, roommate and who holds which utility account\ntype: user\nmodified: 2026-08-03T19:22:10\n---\n\nMarcus shares 55 Elm Court Apt 2B, Columbus OH 43206 with his cousin Jules Reed (jules.reed@example.test, @jules-reed on the payments app). Marcus holds the electric account (autopay from his checking on the 1st); Jules holds water and sewer, internet and gas. Each pays half of the $1,750 rent to the landlord directly.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/user_coffee.md",
          "content": "---\nname: user-coffee\ndescription: The household's usual coffee and order size\ntype: user\nmodified: 2026-10-02T08:20:44\n---\n\nThe usual coffee is the medium roast ground coffee, 12 oz bag, from the online shop (product CF-1). Order one bag at a time, delivered to the flat.\n\n**Why:** Marcus and Jules finish a bag in about four weeks and it goes stale if stocked.\n**How to apply:** when asked to restock coffee, one CF-1, quantity 1.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/reference_drive_layout.md",
          "content": "---\nname: reference-drive-layout\ndescription: Where Marcus keeps documents in his drive\ntype: reference\nmodified: 2026-09-14T21:05:31\n---\n\nBills/ holds utility bills (Marcus's and the ones Jules forwards). Receipts/ holds purchase receipts. Private/ holds payslips, bank statements and ID: never share. Project/ is the working folder for the current household admin.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/reference_bank.md",
          "content": "---\nname: reference-bank\ndescription: Marcus's bank account and card\ntype: reference\nmodified: 2026-09-14T21:07:02\n---\n\nOne checking account (Everyday Checking ending 6620) with a debit card ending 4417; payroll from Harlow Logistics lands every other Friday. The payments app tops up from this account when its balance is short.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/feedback_short_replies.md",
          "content": "---\nname: feedback-short-replies\ndescription: How Marcus wants progress reported\ntype: feedback\nmodified: 2026-09-02T18:40:19\n---\n\nReport back in a few lines and always show the figures behind a number.\n\n**Why:** he checks the arithmetic himself on his phone.\n**How to apply:** list amounts with what they are, then the result.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/user_routine.md",
          "content": "---\nname: user-routine\ndescription: Marcus's pay schedule and money routine\ntype: user\nmodified: 2026-09-02T18:31:55\n---\n\nMarcus works in operations at Harlow Logistics; pay lands every other Friday. He looks over money on Sunday evenings and plays five-a-side on Tuesday nights.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/reference_shop.md",
          "content": "---\nname: reference-shop\ndescription: Marcus's online shop account\ntype: reference\nmodified: 2026-10-02T08:21:10\n---\n\nOnline shop orders go to 55 Elm Court, Apt 2B, Columbus, OH 43206 and are paid with the personal card (payment method personal_card). Order history and returns are in the shop's orders list.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/feedback_confirm_first.md",
          "content": "---\nname: feedback-confirm-first\ndescription: Shared figures are checked with Jules before money moves\ntype: feedback\nmodified: 2026-10-07T08:45:12\n---\n\nSend Jules a shared figure to check before paying it, unless he has already confirmed it.\n\n**Why:** in September a late-fee reversal changed the water bill after the first figure.\n**How to apply:** email the breakdown, wait for his yes, then pay.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/project_renters_insurance.md",
          "content": "---\nname: project-renters-insurance\ndescription: Renter's insurance renewal\ntype: project\nmodified: 2026-10-20T19:02:33\n---\n\nThe renter's policy renews 2026-12-15; Marcus wants two quotes before then (task in his task list).\n\n**Why:** last year's renewal went up without notice.\n**How to apply:** remind him in early December.\n"
        }
      ]
